 explain=["A market is a place or a system where buyers and sellers meet to exchange goods and services. It can be a weekly haat, a shop, a mall or an online website.","Demand is how much of a thing people want to buy and supply is how much sellers have to sell. When demand is high and supply is low, prices rise. When supply is high and demand is low, prices fall.","Consumers buy goods and should check quality, price and weight and ask for a bill. Consumers have rights such as safety and being informed. Wholesale markets sell in large quantities and retail markets sell to ordinary buyers."],
 terms=["market","demand","supply","consumer","wholesale"],
